        "start": 24
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: I assume this means that the Federal Government could also criminalize federally robbery or burglary committed against a private individual who has received Federal funds, who has received a Federal subsidy in one way or another. Right?"
    },
